<https://hexplain.io/ns/audio#TagShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Validation activation: subjects using adv:artist Constraints apply only within that activation or through shape references; they are not global OWL domain axioms."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/audio#TagShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Tag Shape"@en .
